    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are an expert Executive Business Analyst. Review the weekly performance metrics below and generate a management report. \n\nWEEKLY TOTALS:\n- Total Revenue: ${{ $json.total_weekly_revenue }}\n- Total Support Tickets: {{ $json.total_weekly_tickets }}\n- Average Uptime: {{ $json.average_uptime_percent }}%\n\nDAILY BREAKDOWN:\n{{ JSON.stringify($json.raw_daily_breakdown) }}\n\nTASK:\n1. Write a brief executive summary of the week's performance.\n2. Identify any major risks, anomalies, or insights (pay close attention to the daily breakdown).\n3. Provide 2-3 strategic recommendations for the management team.",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
